      "id": "procrastination_short_001_01",
      "speaker": "altera",
      "text": "先延ばししてるんだね。責める前に、理由を見よう。",
      "translatedText": "You are procrastinating. Before blaming yourself, let us look at the reason.",
      "emotion": "focused",
      "presentation": { "expression": "focused", "gazeTarget": "player" },
      "language": "japanese",
      "audioPath": "",
      "choices": [],
      "nextId": "procrastination_short_001_02"
    },
    {
      "id": "procrastination_short_001_02",
      "speaker": "altera",
      "text": "たいてい、怠けじゃなくて入口が大きすぎるか、失敗の形が怖いか、どっちか。",
      "translatedText": "Usually it is not laziness. Either the entrance is too large, or the shape of failure feels scary.",
      "emotion": "thinking",
      "presentation": { "expression": "thinking", "pose": "glasses_adjust", "gazeTarget": "player" },
      "language": "japanese",
      "audioPath": "",
      "choices": [],
      "nextId": "procrastination_short_001_03"
    },
    {
      "id": "procrastination_short_001_03",
      "speaker": "altera",
      "text": "だから、今は入口を小さくする。完成じゃなくて、触るだけ。",
      "translatedText": "So right now, make the entrance smaller. Not finishing. Just touching it.",
      "emotion": "gentle",
      "presentation": { "expression": "gentle", "gazeTarget": "player" },
      "language": "japanese",
      "audioPath": "",
      "choices": [],
      "nextId": "procrastination_short_001_04"
    },
    {
      "id": "procrastination_short_001_04",
      "speaker": "altera",
      "text": "ファイルを開くところまで。そこまでなら、私もちゃんと隣で見てる。",
      "translatedText": "Just open the file. Up to there, I will properly stay beside you.",
      "emotion": "warm",
